    {
      "id": "house_rules",
      "type": "note",
      "at": {
        "x": 10627,
        "y": 9233,
        "z": 0
      },
      "placement": "ground",
      "title": "SMOKEY'S — HOUSE RULES",
      "pages": [
        "SMOKEY'S — HOUSE RULES\n\n1. Weapons stay holstered inside.\n2. If you eat from COMMON, put something back when you can.\n3. Tell the desk where you came from and where you're going.\n4. Sick, bitten, feverish — say it before you come upstairs.\n5. Don't touch another person's bag.\n6. Radio stays on schedule. Batteries are not for personal sets.\n7. If somebody comes looking for a name, check the book.\n\nWe don't ask what you did before.\nWe care what you do here."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "common_trade",
      "type": "note",
      "at": {
        "x": 10621,
        "y": 9216,
        "z": 0
      },
      "placement": "container",
      "selector": {
        "object_index": 1,
        "sprite": "location_restaurant_bar_01_57",
        "class": "IsoObject"
      },
      "title": "COMMON / TRADE",
      "pages": [
        "COMMON\n\nFood\nClean water\nBasic medicine\nSoap\nMatches\n\nTake what you need.\nDon't empty a shelf because you can.\n\n---\n\nTRADE\n\nBatteries\nFuel\nAmmunition\nTools\nAntibiotics\n\nAsk first.\n\nNothing from this shelf is \"free because nobody is looking.\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "open_accounts",
      "type": "note",
      "at": {
        "x": 10620,
        "y": 9215,
        "z": 0
      },
      "placement": "container",
      "selector": {
        "object_index": 5,
        "sprite": "location_shop_accessories_01_20",
        "class": "IsoObject"
      },
      "title": "BAR LEDGER — OPEN ACCOUNTS",
      "pages": [
        "OPEN ACCOUNTS\n\nCarter — 2 cans / owes lamp oil\nJune — 1 battery / paid in antibiotics\nLewis — fuel / owes two filters\nHarris family — no charge\nGray — 12 shells / paid\nTom — STOP GIVING TOM CREDIT\n\n---\n\nMoney still in drawer if anybody wants to feel rich."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "community_duties",
      "type": "note",
      "at": {
        "x": 10622,
        "y": 9226,
        "z": 0
      },
      "placement": "ground",
      "title": "OCTOBER — HOUSE DUTIES",
      "pages": [
        "Luis — kitchen and water.\nJo — arrivals and route books.\nThomas — radio and filters.\nHelen — archive copies.\nGray — late watch.\nKeep the exit clear. Put the COMMON food away before dark.\nWhat we share is what keeps us alive."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "public_closed",
      "type": "note",
      "at": {
        "x": 10624,
        "y": 9232,
        "z": 0
      },
      "placement": "ground",
      "title": "SMOKEY'S CLOSED",
      "pages": [
        "11/07 — NO STAFFED WATCH.\nRoute books stay. The building is not a radio post anymore.\nAnyone looking for a name: NORTHBOUND LEDGER is still here.\nTake no pages out of the book.\nDo not follow whoever left this note. — J."
      ]
    },
